-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data and third-party content

The MIT licence covers this project's code and its own curated data files
(data/curated/*.json). It does not cover third-party material referred to by
those files:

- Event descriptions summarise and cite published sources; the sources remain
  the property of their publishers and are linked, not copied.
- Photographs are linked to their source pages with the licence each states;
  none are redistributed in this repository.
- Basemaps, elevation and the OpenStreetMap 3D Buildings layer are loaded at
  run time from Esri services under their own terms. OpenStreetMap data is
  (c) OpenStreetMap contributors under the ODbL 1.0; if you run
  `npm run data:osm`, the derived street layer is subject to the ODbL.
- The ArcGIS Maps SDK for JavaScript and Calcite Design System are used under
  Esri's licence terms.
